   "name": "team_confirm",
   "title": "Team 確認",
   "description": "收到 needs_confirmation：show 睇返張單（唔扣錢、唔 consume），用戶批咗先帶 confirm_token 重 call。approval:\"user\"（預設）嘅單一定要用戶喺 approve_url（AlgoHash 批核頁）親自批，wait 等佢撳；對話講「批」唔算。\nActions:\n- show: 睇確認單內容（approval:\"user\" 會有 approve_url 俾用戶撳）\n- wait: 等用戶喺 AlgoHash 批核頁批准／拒絕（最多 50 秒；仲係 open 就再 call）",
   "inputSchema": {
    "type": "object",
    "required": [
     "action"
    ],
    "properties": {
     "action": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
